<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-PARIS OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-PARIS OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results in the $450,000</p>
<p>Paris Open women's tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>3-Anke Huber (Germany) beat 2-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) 6-3</p>
<p>6-4</p>
